<title>INDIA: India February industrial output up 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>India February industrial output up 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's industrial production in February 1997 rose 2.4 percent compared with the same month in the previous year, the Planning Commission said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>The statement said the industrial production index for the period from April 1996 to February 1997 was 7.0 percent higher than in the corresponding period in the 1995/96 (April-March) year.</p>
